        },
        {
          "text": "wamtshela inhliziyo yakhe yonke, wathi kuye: “Akuzange kufinyelelwe mpuco ekhanda lami; ngoba ngangingumNaziri kaNkulunkulu kwasesizalweni sikamama.",
