        },
        {
          "text": "UDelila esebonile ukuthi wayemtshelile yonke inhliziyo yakhe, wathumela wabiza izikhulu zamaFilisti, wathi: “Khuphukani ngalesi sikhathi, ngokuba ungibonisile yonke inhliziyo yakhe.” Khona-ke izikhulu zamaFilisti zenyukela kuye zaletha imali ezandleni zazo.",
