              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamyeka walala emadolweni akhe; wabiza umuntu, waphuca izihluthu eziyisikhombisa zezinwele zekhanda lakhe; waqala ukumcindezela, amandla akhe asuka kuye.",
