              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: “AmaFilisti aphezu kwakho, Samsoni; Wavuka ebuthongweni bakhe, wathi: “Ngiyakuphuma njengakuqala ngithuthumele.” Futhi wayengazi ukuthi uJehova wayemukile kuye.",
          "type": "text",
