          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izikhulu zamaFilisti zabuthana ukuba zenze umhlatshelo omkhulu kuDagoni unkulunkulu wazo, zijabule; ngoba bathi: Unkulunkulu wethu unikele isitha sethu uSamsoni esandleni sethu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
