          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Base behla abafowabo nendlu yonke kayise, bamthatha, bamenyusa, bammbela phakathi kweSoreya ne-Eshitawoli ethuneni likayise uManowa. Wabusa u-Israyeli iminyaka engamashumi amabili.",
          "type": "text",
